From: YaPcore Agent 3 <agent-3@yapcore>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP defer cross-region neighbor updates at shard borders

Defer foreign-pos CollectingNeighborUpdater.addAndRun onto owning region
tick queue; prefer empty-section cut lines in YapSubRegionPartitioner.
Post-applyAllPatches. Depends on 0014 force-partition.
